## EigenLayer Specific Patterns

### Restaking Security

```solidity
// Key risks in restaking:
// 1. Operator can be slashed by multiple AVSs
// 2. Withdrawal delays compound
// 3. Share dilution during slashing

// SECURE approach
function getWithdrawableAssets(address user) public view returns (uint256) {
    uint256 shares = balanceOf(user);
    uint256 pendingSlashes = getPendingSlashAmount();
    
    // Account for potential slashing
    uint256 effectiveAssets = totalAssets() - pendingSlashes;
    return shares * effectiveAssets / totalSupply();
}
```

