## Staking Audit Checklist

### Reward Mechanics
- [ ] Rewards based on time-weighted balance, not snapshot
- [ ] Flash loan attacks on rewards mitigated
- [ ] Minimum stake duration enforced
- [ ] Reward calculation overflow-safe

### Exchange Rate
- [ ] First depositor attack mitigated
- [ ] Donation attacks handled
- [ ] Rate changes are gradual/capped

### Slashing
- [ ] Slashing conditions well-defined
- [ ] Multi-party verification for slashes
- [ ] Unbonding period subjects funds to slashing
- [ ] Slash amount bounded

### Withdrawals
- [ ] Appropriate unbonding period
- [ ] Queue/priority system for liquidity
- [ ] Griefing vectors mitigated
- [ ] Emergency withdrawal exists

### Operators (LRT)
- [ ] Operator whitelist/governance
- [ ] Delegation limits
- [ ] Operator performance tracking
- [ ] Slashing propagation handled

### Token Handling
- [ ] Rebasing tokens handled correctly
- [ ] Fee-on-transfer tokens considered
- [ ] Decimal handling correct
